 a future Prime Minister of France, first used X as a noun to describe these signatories. On February 1, the nationalist writer Maurice Barrès seized the same word in Le Journal and turned it into a sneer, calling the signatories \"half-Xs\" and \"so-called Xs,\" a waste product of society dealing in abstractions rather than patriotism. Well, at least Barrès needed a qualifier. ID X which is often used as an insult by the right.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:48:13Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Intellectuals", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:48:15Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Liberandu 🙈", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:48:25Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Intellectual is correct", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:48:36Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "great question and crack", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:48:40Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Emile Zola, born on this day in 1840.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:48:49Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Bhai yeh Zola ka question tha. 🙏🏽", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:48:53Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Lovely question", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:49:26Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Zola ka dola!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:49:26Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Scores: Pavan 25,